// `Instruction.ChangeLife` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). Unlike the other aliases it still
// takes an agent, though no caller passes one a performer any more: extort
// writes `act(each(opponent), loseLife(1))`. The parameter goes with the
// agent fields (`semantics-v2-drop-agent-fields`).
(
    name: "changeLife",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"delta": Delta, "agent": Subject},
    body: ChangeLife(delta: Param(delta), agent: Param(agent)),
)
